{"name":"Pixel Picker: Color Inspector","dev":"Andrea Bizzotto","keys":["ios:930804327"],"ios":{"id":"930804327","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/pixel-picker-color-inspector/id930804327?uo=4","rating":4.43574,"ratings":179,"price":"Free","genre":"Utilities","screens":["https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/cc/19/85/cc1985a0-02b1-a336-66d5-17023d9628ab/0_APP_IPHONE_67_0.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/37/61/6b/37616bdb-19df-3bfb-5ddc-bdeecbe29ba1/0_APP_IPHONE_67_1.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/c1/ab/6a/c1ab6aed-b61e-e10a-3662-f16e01cd7335/0_APP_IPHONE_67_2.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/17/73/4f/17734f7b-5e69-b326-89af-0c2ab15fdd11/0_APP_IPHONE_67_3.png/320x480bb.jpg"],"desc":"Pixel Picker helps you identify exact colors in any photo.\n\nImport an image from Photos, then pan and zoom until the crosshair is over the pixel you need. Instantly view its HEX and RGB values, plus its coordinates in the image.\n\nFEATURES  \n• Open images from Photos or the share sheet  \n• Pinch to zoom and pan for precise pixel selection  \n• View colors in HEX and RGB formats  \n• See pixel coordinates  \n• Export the image with its selected color information  \n• Works with portrait and landscape images on iPhone and iPad  \n\nEnjoy!","released":"2014-11-10","updated":"2026-09-26","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/cf/82/cc/cf82cc45-a1cd-1a2c-f823-4dd575751fc1/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-8-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","age":"4+"},"android":null,"icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/cf/82/cc/cf82cc45-a1cd-1a2c-f823-4dd575751fc1/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-8-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","cat":"Utilities","rating":4.44,"ratings":179,"mentions":1,"users":1,"threads":1,"hn_points":8,"hn_comments":0,"submissions":1,"self_n":1,"hn_score":3.17,"first":1416944940,"last